"пользователя и быстрым взаимодействием со статусами через карточку."
msgstr ""
"The widget adds a :ref:`kanban board <kanban_board>` to the card with a "
"customizable journal, related attributes and templates for user "
"convenience and quick interaction with statuses through the card."

#: ../../introduction/modules.rst:591
